C. GUARD BITES. Resuming the same checkpoint with a DIFFERENT --epochs (4 -> 6) is refused:
     "refusing to resume: the checkpoint is a DIFFERENT run.  epochs: checkpoint=4 requested=6"
   Same for a different --objective (solo:POOL -> solo:AALTO). Both exit non-zero without
   running an epoch.
   WHY THIS MATTERS: per_epoch = budget*overshoot/(epochs*islands), so a resume with a
   different --epochs re-scales every remaining epoch's spend -- the resumed run is then a
   different search wearing the same output filename. Found by testing resume, not by reading.
